/*
  TirePressureVisualWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0102 · TirePressureVisualWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `TirePressureVisualWidget` resolves (table "TirePressureVisualWidget") lives
  here with its web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the
  app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept
  in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings
  without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/TirePressureVisualWidget.tsx). The registry group
  mirrors registry/tires.ts. The remaining keys back the native-only chrome
  (freshness chip, refresh/retry/empty/error copy, accessibility).
*/

